# Drop additional .patch files here. They will be auto-applied (-p1, --forward) after
# SukiSU + SUSFS integration. Name them with a numeric prefix to control order, e.g.:
#   10-fix-dtbo-magic.patch
#   20-extra-hardening.patch
#
# A patch named exactly `susfs_sukisu_hooks.patch` is reserved and applied during the
# SUSFS step (use it only if your kernel tree needs the SukiSU manual-hook patch).
